  "text_v0": "Stock Picking Invoice Link\n\nAdds link between pickings and invoices\n\n## DESCRIPTION\nThe base module used by sale_stock_picking_invoice_link and purchase_stock_picking_invoice_link \nto adds a link between pickings and invoices as well as on the lines.\n\n## USAGE\n- Create a Sales Order and confirm.\n- Deliver its pickings totally or partially.\n- Create an invoice of the goods delivered.\n- If you open invoice form, you must see a new Pickings tab with\n  information about them.",
  "text": "Stock Picking Invoice Link\n\nAdds link between pickings and invoices\n\n## DESCRIPTION\nThe base module used by sale_stock_picking_invoice_link and purchase_stock_picking_invoice_link \nto adds a link between pickings and invoices as well as on the lines.\n\n## USAGE\n- Create a Sales Order and confirm.\n- Deliver its pickings totally or partially.\n- Create an invoice of the goods delivered.\n- If you open invoice form, you must see a new Pickings tab with\n  information about them.\n\n## GITHUB ISSUES (selected)\n### #292 [9.0] [stock_picking_invoice_link] Previous customer invoice linked to backorder DO (issue, closed, 2017)\nModule : stock_picking_invoice_link for version 9.0\r\nSuppose I have 1 SO with 1 kind of product with qty=3. \r\nI create Invoice from sales order partially (eq. 2), for eq. INV-0001\r\nThen I release the DO partially using 2 quantity, with back order (WH/OUT/0001 as delivered and WH/OUT/0002 as available), INV-0001 is still linked into WH/OUT/0002.\r\nThis is not the correct way I think. In WH/OUT/0002 there should be no INV-0001. CMIIW\r\nThank you.\n\n### #434 [11.0] stock_picking_invoice_link, picking link not removed when removing invoice line (issue, closed, 2018)\nWhen the invoice line of a related picking in an invoice is removed. The relation is not removed.\r\nReproduce:\r\n1. create invoice from sale order with multiple deliveries\r\n2. check how many pickings are linked\r\n3. Remove one the invoice lines\r\n4. Same amount of pickings are linked\n\n### #578 [11.0] stock_picking_invoice_link (issue, closed, 2019)\nWhen there are returns of delivery notes they do not appear in the list of delivery notes. \r\nIf invoices with positive and negative quantities to avoid making credit invoices\n\n### #780 [13.0] stock_picking_invoice_link not show all related invoices on picking (issue, closed, 2021)\nSteps to reproduce:\r\n1-Make a sale of stockable product 2 und\r\n2-Do the picking delivery for the 2 und\r\n3-Sale order is up to invoice, but on invoice decrease qty and do 1 und invoice\r\n4-Sale order is still up to invoice, then do the invoice for the remain 1 und\r\n5-At this point we have 2 invoices on the same picking, go to the picking and click on invoices smart button\r\n6-Only the first invoice form its shown\r\nSpected behaivor:\r\na tree view with the 2 related invoices\r\nTy\n\n### #127 Feature request: stock_picking_invoice_link, Print the liste of pickings on invoices (issue, closed, 2015)\nIn France (and probably elsewhere) it's now mandatory to print the delivery date of the goods on invoices.\nSince `stock_picking_invoice_link` adds the list of pickings on the invoice form, I suggest we extend stock_picking_invoice_link to print the picking references and delivery dates at the bottom of the invoices.",
